      "title": "Removed formatPrice export still imported by cart",
      "description": "This change renames formatPrice to formatMoney in src/money.ts. src/cart.ts still imports formatPrice and calls it at line 8. The TypeScript build fails, so cartTotal cannot ship. Under plain ES modules, loading cart.ts throws a missing export error. Update src/cart.ts to import formatMoney and call formatMoney(addTax(subtotal, taxRate), \"USD\"). Alternatively, keep formatPrice as a wrapper that delegates to formatMoney.",
